{"material_id": "ntce.chuzhong.shuxue.2021b.q14.material.recovered", "text": "在某习题课上，老师让学生独立完成如下例题：如图1，在边长为的正方形ABCD中，E是BC中点，P是对角线BD上的动点，连接PE，PC，当BP为何值时，PE+PC的值最小？最小值是多少？大多数学生表示不会做。教师这样启发：回顾以前学过的“饮马问题”：如图2，牧马人从A地出发，到一条笔直的河边饮马，然后回到B地，牧马人到河边什么地方饮马，所走的路径最短？作点A关于直线的对称点D，连接BD交直线l于点C。由于AC+BC=BC+CD=BD，利用两点之间线段最短，此时点C使AC+BC最小，点c的位置即为所求。学生：哦，会做了....", "source_files": [{"path": "教资/真题/初中真题/2021年下半年教师资格证考试《初中数学》题（考生回忆版）.csv", "role": "material_raw", "sha256": "6d07dfc4e5d4b3677a862e3929c2724583a97605358d3f7cb7dfcd6171fbd526", "locator": {"decoded_csv_character_start": 878, "decoded_csv_character_end": 1141, "next_source_question_number": 16, "alignment_status": "unique_task_excerpt_with_preceding_case_section"}}, {"path": "教资/真题/初中真题/2021年下半年教师资格证考试《初中数学》题（考生回忆版）.csv", "role": "question_raw", "locator": {"paper_order": 14, "alignment_status": "pending"}, "sha256": "6d07dfc4e5d4b3677a862e3929c2724583a97605358d3f7cb7dfcd6171fbd526"}], "review": {"content_verified": false, "status": "auto_parsed", "extraction_status": "source_interval_recovered_pending_expert"}, "question_ids": ["ntce.chuzhong.shuxue.2021b.q14"], "knowledge_node_ids": ["ntce.chuzhong.shuxue.s1.k06", "ntce.chuzhong.shuxue.s1.k10", "ntce.chuzhong.shuxue.s4.k01"], "ability_ids": ["ntce.chuzhong.ability.evaluate", "ntce.chuzhong.ability.manage", "ntce.chuzhong.ability.subject"], "exam_requirement_ids": [], "used_by_questions": ["ntce.chuzhong.shuxue.2021b.q14"], "word_count": 263, "level": "chuzhong", "subject": "shuxue", "kind": "case_material", "source": {"origin_file": "教资/真题/初中真题/2021年下半年教师资格证考试《初中数学》题（考生回忆版）.csv", "files": [{"path": "教资/真题/初中真题/2021年下半年教师资格证考试《初中数学》题（考生回忆版）.csv", "role": "material_raw", "sha256": "6d07dfc4e5d4b3677a862e3929c2724583a97605358d3f7cb7dfcd6171fbd526", "locator": {"decoded_csv_character_start": 878, "decoded_csv_character_end": 1141, "next_source_question_number": 16, "alignment_status": "unique_task_excerpt_with_preceding_case_section"}}, {"path": "教资/真题/初中真题/2021年下半年教师资格证考试《初中数学》题（考生