{"material_id": "ntce.chuzhong.shuxue.2021b.q15.material.recovered", "text": "下面是某教材有理数一章中“绝对值”一节的内容片段：两辆汽车从同一处出发，分别向东、西方向行驶10km，到达A、B两处，它们的行驶路线相同吗?它们的行驶路程相等吗？一般地，数轴上表示数a的点与原点的距离叫做数a的绝对值，记作例如，图中A、B两点分别表示10和-10，它们与原点的距离都是10个单位长度，所以10和-10的绝对值都是10，即，，显然。由绝对值的定义可知：一个正数的绝对值是它本身；一个负数的绝对值是它的相反数；0的绝对值是0。即（1）如果，那么；（2）如果，那么；（3）如果，那么根据上述内容，完成下列任务：", "source_files": [{"path": "教资/真题/初中真题/2021年下半年教师资格证考试《初中数学》题（考生回忆版）.csv", "role": "material_raw", "sha256": "6d07dfc4e5d4b3677a862e3929c2724583a97605358d3f7cb7dfcd6171fbd526", "locator": {"decoded_csv_character_start": 1221, "decoded_csv_character_end": 1481, "next_source_question_number": 17, "alignment_status": "unique_task_excerpt_with_preceding_case_section"}}, {"path": "教资/真题/初中真题/2021年下半年教师资格证考试《初中数学》题（考生回忆版）.csv", "role": "question_raw", "locator": {"paper_order": 15, "alignment_status": "pending"}, "sha256": "6d07dfc4e5d4b3677a862e3929c2724583a97605358d3f7cb7dfcd6171fbd526"}], "review": {"content_verified": false, "status": "auto_parsed", "extraction_status": "source_interval_recovered_pending_expert"}, "question_ids": ["ntce.chuzhong.shuxue.2021b.q15"], "knowledge_node_ids": ["ntce.chuzhong.shuxue.s3.k02", "ntce.chuzhong.shuxue.s3.k03", "ntce.chuzhong.shuxue.s3.k04"], "ability_ids": ["ntce.chuzhong.ability.design"], "exam_requirement_ids": ["ntce.outline.304.r011", "ntce.outline.304.r015", "ntce.outline.304.r017", "ntce.outline.304.r022"], "used_by_questions": ["ntce.chuzhong.shuxue.2021b.q15"], "word_count": 260, "level": "chuzhong", "subject": "shuxue", "kind": "lesson_plan_material", "source": {"origin_file": "教资/真题/初中真题/2021年下半年教师资格证考试《初中数学》题（考生回忆版）.csv", "files": [{"path": "教资/真题/初中真题/2021年下半年教师资格证考试《初中数学》题（考生回忆版）.csv", "role": "material_raw", "sha256": "6d07dfc4e5d4b3677a862e3929c2724583a97605358d3f7cb7dfcd6171fbd526", "locator": {"decoded_csv_character_start": 1221, "decoded_csv_character_end": 1481, "next_source_question_number": 17, "alignment_status": "unique_task_excerpt_with_preceding_case_section"}}, {"path": 